VideoTED

The training runtime in verl/ is adapted from Self-Distilled RLVR (RLSD).
https://github.com/iie-ycx/RLSD

RLSD builds on EasyVideoR1, EasyR1, and veRL.
https://github.com/cyuQ1n/EasyVideoR1
https://github.com/hiyouga/EasyR1
https://github.com/volcengine/verl

Original copyright and license notices are retained in the source files.
VideoTED adds action-tree conditioning, the reference-trajectory objective,
and the action-recognition training recipe. See LICENSE for Apache-2.0.
